# What belongs in this repository: the site's source (src/, index.html, configs), what it serves
# (public/), the workflow that deploys it, and the tools that draw its pictures (tools/manga).
# Everything below is local to this machine.

# Dependencies and build output
node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
*.tsbuildinfo

# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Editor and system files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Photographs and documents the pictures are made from: raw and personal. Only the drawings
